# CloudPDF Studio — Frontend Environment Configuration
# ======================================================

# API Base URL:
# - Leave empty (default) when running behind a reverse proxy (e.g., Nginx on EC2)
#   or when using the Vite dev server proxy (proxying /api to http://localhost:8000).
# - Set to an absolute URL (e.g., https://api.cloudpdf.example.com) only if the frontend
#   is hosted on a decoupled origin or separate CDN (e.g., S3/CloudFront).
VITE_API_URL=

